# P4.1b: Bundle Size Estimation & Limits Enforcement

**Parent Phase:** Phase 4: Wizard & Deployment
**Section Reference:** Plan Document Section 5 FR-4.1, Section 8.1
**Depends On:** P4.1a (Bundle Builder)

## Goal

Implement accurate size estimation before export and enforce GitHub Pages limits during bundle generation.

## GitHub Pages Limits (Hard Constraints)

| Limit | Value | Action |
|-------|-------|--------|
| Total site size | 1 GB | **Block export** |
| Per-file hard block | 100 MiB | **Block** that chunk |
| Per-file warning | 50 MiB | **Warn** user |
| Bandwidth/month | 100 GB soft | N/A (not enforceable) |

## Size Estimation Algorithm

### Pre-Export Estimation

```rust
pub struct SizeEstimate {
    pub plaintext_bytes: u64,     // Raw SQLite + precomputed data
    pub compressed_bytes: u64,    // After deflate (estimate: 40-60% ratio)
    pub encrypted_bytes: u64,     // After AEAD (overhead: ~16 bytes/chunk)
    pub static_assets_bytes: u64, // HTML/JS/CSS/WASM
    pub total_site_bytes: u64,    // Final estimate
    pub chunk_count: u32,         // Number of payload chunks
}

impl SizeEstimate {
    pub fn from_filter(db: &Database, filter: &ExportFilter) -> Result<Self> {
        // Query message content sizes
        let plaintext = db.query_scalar::<u64>("
            SELECT SUM(LENGTH(content))
            FROM messages m
            JOIN conversations c ON m.conversation_id = c.id
            WHERE c.agent IN (?) AND ...
        ", filter)?;

        // Estimate compression (typical ratio: 0.45 for text)
        let compressed = (plaintext as f64 * 0.45) as u64;

        // AEAD overhead: 16 bytes auth tag per chunk
        let chunk_count = (compressed / CHUNK_SIZE) + 1;
        let encrypted = compressed + (chunk_count * 16);

        // Static assets (HTML, JS, WASM)
        let static_assets = STATIC_ASSET_SIZE; // ~2MB constant

        let total = encrypted + static_assets;

        Ok(Self { plaintext, compressed, encrypted, static_assets, total, chunk_count })
    }
}
```

### Display in Wizard (Step 5)

```
Estimated bundle size: 24.5 MB (encrypted)
  • Payload: 23.1 MB (4 chunks × 8 MiB max)
  • Static assets: 1.4 MB
  • Compression ratio: ~42%
```

## Limit Enforcement

### During Export (Runtime Check)

```rust
pub fn check_size_limits(estimate: &SizeEstimate) -> Result<(), SizeError> {
    // Hard block at 1GB
    if estimate.total > 1_073_741_824 {
        return Err(SizeError::TotalExceedsLimit {
            actual: estimate.total,
            limit: 1_073_741_824,
            suggestion: "Consider filtering to fewer agents or shorter time range",
        });
    }

    // Per-chunk limit (shouldn't happen with 8MiB default)
    let max_chunk = estimate.chunk_size + 16; // + auth tag
    if max_chunk > 104_857_600 {
        return Err(SizeError::ChunkExceedsLimit {
            chunk_size: max_chunk,
            limit: 104_857_600,
        });
    }

    Ok(())
}
```

### Post-Export Verification

```rust
pub fn verify_bundle_sizes(site_dir: &Path) -> Vec<SizeWarning> {
    let mut warnings = Vec::new();

    for entry in walkdir::WalkDir::new(site_dir) {
        let path = entry.path();
        let size = std::fs::metadata(path)?.len();

        if size > 104_857_600 {
            // This shouldn't happen - chunking should prevent it
            panic\!("File {} exceeds 100 MiB - chunking failed\!", path.display());
        }

        if size > 52_428_800 {
            warnings.push(SizeWarning::LargeFile {
                path: path.to_path_buf(),
                size,
            });
        }
    }

    let total: u64 = walkdir::WalkDir::new(site_dir)
        .into_iter()
        .filter_map(|e| e.ok())
        .filter_map(|e| std::fs::metadata(e.path()).ok())
        .map(|m| m.len())
        .sum();

    if total > 1_073_741_824 {
        panic\!("Total site size {} exceeds 1 GB limit\!", total);
    }

    warnings
}
```

## User-Facing Messages

### Pre-Export Warning
```
⚠️  LARGE EXPORT WARNING

Estimated size: 850 MB (approaching 1 GB GitHub Pages limit)

Options:
  [1] Reduce time range (currently: all time)
  [2] Exclude some agents
  [3] Exclude some workspaces
  [4] Continue anyway
```

### Export Blocked
```
❌ EXPORT BLOCKED

Estimated size: 1.3 GB exceeds GitHub Pages 1 GB limit.

You must reduce content to export:
  • Use --since "90 days ago" for recent conversations only
  • Use --agents claude-code to limit to one agent
  • Use --workspaces /path/one to limit projects
```

## Test Cases

1. Small export → no warnings
2. 50-100MB chunks → warning shown
3. >100MB chunk → error (shouldn't happen)
4. >1GB total → blocked with suggestions
5. Estimate within 20% of actual
6. Empty filter → full size estimate

