# FR-6: Redaction & Share Profiles

## Overview
Encryption protects archives from the public internet—but once you share the password with a teammate, they can see everything. Redaction provides an additional layer of protection for safe sharing by removing sensitive content BEFORE encryption.

## Export Profiles

### Profile Definitions
